WEBVTT

00:03.420 --> 00:04.713
I asked you.

00:05.714 --> 00:06.840
I told you to stop.

00:16.725 --> 00:19.811
Don't cross the line, all right?
Know when to stop.

00:23.773 --> 00:24.649
What?

00:24.733 --> 00:28.778
Me? I'm like your guardian angel
who just woke up from a nap.

00:29.779 --> 00:31.239
Unconditioned reflex.

00:31.322 --> 00:34.784
If an object suddenly appears,
you instinctively shut your eyes.

00:34.868 --> 00:37.078
It's an innate response to stimuli.

00:43.793 --> 00:45.420
Knock it off, you nutcase,

00:45.503 --> 00:47.589
or you're really going to get hit.

00:52.177 --> 00:53.720
I said knock it off.

00:54.637 --> 00:56.848
Don't tell me what to do.

01:05.774 --> 01:06.775
What are you doing?

01:16.326 --> 01:17.702
No! Put it down!

01:18.411 --> 01:20.663
What are you doing now?

01:21.247 --> 01:22.540
Jeez, Teach.

01:23.374 --> 01:25.585
I was trying to stop them from fighting,

01:25.668 --> 01:27.962
and I was almost put in danger.

01:28.046 --> 01:29.339
I am really sorry.

01:30.632 --> 01:31.716
Quick! Apologize!

01:36.096 --> 01:37.180
Now!

02:20.515 --> 02:25.645
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

03:18.656 --> 03:22.076
JEONGJIN SEOUL HOSPITAL

03:22.160 --> 03:23.161
Yes.

03:23.786 --> 03:25.747
Yes, we just got to the hospital.

03:28.541 --> 03:29.918
Yes, we'll talk it through.

03:31.711 --> 03:33.004
Don't worry.

03:34.422 --> 03:35.715
I'll let you know.

03:37.217 --> 03:38.801
What were you thinking?

03:39.719 --> 03:41.221
Ma'am, please calm down.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.723
Why are you alone? Where's your mother?

03:46.142 --> 03:47.060
I'm sorry.

03:47.143 --> 03:49.479
I don't need your apology.
Just bring your mom.

03:51.731 --> 03:52.732
I have no mom.

03:53.274 --> 03:54.651
There's always something.

03:55.610 --> 03:58.780
I'll be sending you
to juvenile detention for sure!

03:58.863 --> 03:59.739
Got it?

04:06.829 --> 04:08.831
Yeong-bin made another kid

04:10.124 --> 04:11.417
put this on my neck.

04:12.418 --> 04:13.253
What is that?

04:15.588 --> 04:17.257
- That's--
- A drug.

04:18.007 --> 04:18.841
It's a drug.

04:20.760 --> 04:22.470
What's this fucking bullshit?

04:23.054 --> 04:23.972
You have proof?

04:24.639 --> 04:26.349
Fuck, can you prove I did it?

04:27.100 --> 04:28.810
You still don't get it.

04:29.394 --> 04:30.937
This is your bag, right?

04:34.065 --> 04:38.069
FENTANYL PATCHES

04:44.701 --> 04:48.079
You do realize this isn't just
a school violence issue now?

04:50.164 --> 04:53.209
I think Yeong-bin should transfer
to another school.

04:56.212 --> 04:57.922
If this gets out…

04:58.715 --> 04:59.632
Well…

05:01.384 --> 05:02.969
Let's just let it slide.

05:33.791 --> 05:35.001
Hey, Si-eun!

05:36.169 --> 05:37.920
What's wrong with your hands?

05:39.839 --> 05:41.257
I got hurt in gym class.

05:42.425 --> 05:43.301
Let me see.

05:46.137 --> 05:47.513
Did you pass out again?

05:48.514 --> 05:50.683
No, I don't do that anymore.

06:00.693 --> 06:02.070
Hey, kid.

06:02.945 --> 06:05.573
Now you're fighting with your classmates?

06:08.242 --> 06:09.660
Hey, it's fine.

06:09.744 --> 06:12.246
Men are supposed to fight as they grow up.

06:13.039 --> 06:14.749
I've been there too.

06:15.666 --> 06:16.959
It's not like that.

06:18.544 --> 06:21.506
Did you at least get to throw a punch?

06:28.388 --> 06:30.139
Fine, I get it. Rest up.

06:30.973 --> 06:32.100
Puberty, huh?

07:44.839 --> 07:46.132
Hey, fucker.

07:48.593 --> 07:49.719
See me after class.

07:50.428 --> 07:52.930
You caught me off guard, you bastard.

07:53.848 --> 07:55.808
You're gonna fucking die today.

08:02.523 --> 08:03.649
Let's do it now.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.361
Crazy asshole.

08:07.445 --> 08:09.280
That son of a bitch. Seriously.

08:13.367 --> 08:15.786
- Should we stop them?
- Looks like a fight.

08:44.607 --> 08:45.608
You guys

08:46.734 --> 08:48.528
aren't good at learning, are you?

08:49.445 --> 08:50.738
The fuck you say?

09:10.258 --> 09:11.926
If your memory is bad…

09:13.970 --> 09:15.388
you need to review more.

09:25.982 --> 09:27.441
Pavlov's dogs experiment…

09:31.904 --> 09:33.072
Ring the bell.

09:34.782 --> 09:35.783
Give a treat.

09:37.034 --> 09:38.578
The dog salivates.

09:40.788 --> 09:42.039
Ring the bell.

09:43.874 --> 09:45.001
Give a treat.

09:47.128 --> 09:48.671
The dog salivates.

09:53.551 --> 09:55.761
Only ring the bell.

09:57.972 --> 09:58.931
Let's stop.

09:59.849 --> 10:00.808
I'm asking you.

10:02.184 --> 10:03.019
Do me

10:04.770 --> 10:05.730
a favor.

10:21.871 --> 10:24.665
He's totally fine and not hurt at all!

10:25.458 --> 10:27.335
Hey, Si-eun, how'd it go?

10:27.418 --> 10:29.670
Did you totally lay out those assholes?

10:36.969 --> 10:37.803
Do I know you?

10:42.308 --> 10:43.309
Are we close?

11:28.896 --> 11:30.731
What? Where did everyone go?

12:05.516 --> 12:06.976
I told you to watch yourself.

12:11.856 --> 12:12.690
What is it?

12:15.901 --> 12:17.445
Nice chance for a nose job.

12:24.285 --> 12:25.369
Who was it?

12:26.912 --> 12:27.747
A classmate.

12:28.497 --> 12:29.832
How much will you pay me?

12:31.125 --> 12:32.293
How much do you want?

12:33.753 --> 12:35.379
Fuck, are you rich?

12:37.465 --> 12:39.008
I wish I had your dad.

12:45.222 --> 12:46.223
"Please help me."

12:47.433 --> 12:48.267
"Sir."

12:50.644 --> 12:51.479
Say it.

12:52.396 --> 12:53.731
"Please help me, sir."

12:56.233 --> 12:57.151
Please help me.

12:58.944 --> 12:59.779
Sir.

13:21.300 --> 13:23.385
How come we keep crossing paths?

13:23.469 --> 13:25.554
Were we married in our past lives?

13:25.638 --> 13:26.639
Where are you going?

13:28.265 --> 13:29.308
Home.

13:30.351 --> 13:31.227
What?

13:33.771 --> 13:34.605
Home!

13:35.815 --> 13:36.899
From cram school?

13:37.650 --> 13:38.484
Yeah.

13:44.949 --> 13:45.783
I'm sorry.

13:46.575 --> 13:47.576
Now you're sorry?

13:48.244 --> 13:50.329
If you are, then buy me some food later.

13:50.412 --> 13:51.872
I'm off. See you later!

14:15.896 --> 14:17.106
I'll take these two.

14:17.189 --> 14:18.190
Delivery's here!

14:19.650 --> 14:20.860
Delivery's here!

14:35.374 --> 14:36.458
Delivery is here.

14:36.542 --> 14:38.669
- How about some candy?
- Yes, please.

14:40.254 --> 14:41.463
Keep it quiet, okay?

15:09.742 --> 15:13.746
BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL

15:13.829 --> 15:15.456
FACULTY SHOWER ROOM

16:13.847 --> 16:15.015
It's lunch break.

16:15.516 --> 16:16.350
Yeah.

16:17.768 --> 16:18.686
I'm good.

16:19.812 --> 16:20.729
I'm buying.

16:27.361 --> 16:28.696
What's with that look?

16:30.155 --> 16:31.156
I won't eat.

16:40.290 --> 16:42.626
I didn't expect anything fancy,

16:43.669 --> 16:45.879
but I've already paid for my school food.

16:45.963 --> 16:47.381
Then don't eat.

16:51.218 --> 16:52.219
Bon appétit!

16:58.559 --> 16:59.393
So…

17:01.437 --> 17:02.813
why do you sleep at school?

17:03.313 --> 17:04.898
I come here right after work.

17:04.982 --> 17:06.734
If I go home, I'll oversleep.

17:07.818 --> 17:11.989
Grandma says even if I don't make it
into college, I shouldn't skip school.

17:15.117 --> 17:16.952
Do you like listening to music?

17:18.454 --> 17:19.955
You always have earbuds in.

17:20.456 --> 17:21.290
It's rude.

17:24.376 --> 17:26.211
- I get annoyed.
- What?

17:27.254 --> 17:29.631
I wear them so people won't talk to me.

17:30.215 --> 17:32.051
You're fucking weird, man.

17:32.134 --> 17:33.635
Look who's talking.

17:44.938 --> 17:45.939
Hey.

17:46.023 --> 17:47.733
Why's Si-eun not in trouble?

17:47.816 --> 17:48.817
I heard

17:49.610 --> 17:51.487
that Yeong-bin had fucking fentanyl.

17:51.570 --> 17:53.655
- Really?
- You're exaggerating.

17:53.739 --> 17:56.283
It's true. They're gonna cover it up
and move on.

17:56.366 --> 17:58.577
But why are they hanging out together?

17:58.660 --> 18:00.829
I know. They're like best friends now.

18:00.913 --> 18:04.833
Su-ho is a damn MMA master.
I heard he almost became a pro fighter.

18:04.917 --> 18:07.377
His counterpunch is fire.

18:07.461 --> 18:09.046
Yeah, he's freaking good.

18:09.129 --> 18:12.716
PURCHASE GAME MONEY

18:24.061 --> 18:25.521
BET

18:36.281 --> 18:37.366
PROMISSORY NOTE

18:37.449 --> 18:39.952
Sign here, here, and here.

18:47.251 --> 18:48.836
Oh, Gucci!

18:49.628 --> 18:50.671
That's lit.

18:57.136 --> 19:00.681
CREDITOR: JEON SEOK-DAE
DEBTOR: KIM WON-SEOK

19:03.809 --> 19:05.394
Sweet. It's on.

19:05.477 --> 19:06.311
So,

19:07.271 --> 19:09.231
when will I get the money?

19:11.859 --> 19:12.693
Leave.

19:23.162 --> 19:24.163
You're late.

19:24.746 --> 19:25.581
Yeah.

19:26.498 --> 19:27.583
Should I be sorry?

19:32.504 --> 19:33.672
They're my crew.

19:34.506 --> 19:35.340
He's my cousin.

19:36.341 --> 19:37.259
A rich fucker.

19:39.553 --> 19:40.387
What?

19:42.222 --> 19:43.849
What are you looking at?

19:44.516 --> 19:45.517
Dickface.

19:46.268 --> 19:47.102
Me?

19:48.020 --> 19:49.021
Fucking harsh.

19:53.859 --> 19:54.693
Hey.

19:56.653 --> 19:57.863
When is the kid out?

20:04.953 --> 20:05.787
Yeon Si-eun!

20:07.164 --> 20:07.998
Yeon Si-eun!

20:11.543 --> 20:12.961
You're not staying to study?

20:13.503 --> 20:14.671
You going to cram school?

20:15.923 --> 20:16.757
Yeah.

20:17.507 --> 20:18.675
Which one?

20:20.344 --> 20:21.261
Daemyeong Academy.

20:22.262 --> 20:25.933
I'm thinking of going to a cram school.
How do you like it?

20:26.475 --> 20:27.434
Should I go too?

20:35.817 --> 20:37.527
You don't need to suck up to me.

20:38.528 --> 20:40.572
And I won't accept an apology.

20:50.290 --> 20:53.835
Let's do it quickly!

21:00.092 --> 21:01.176
You spooked me.

21:02.886 --> 21:04.137
What? Class is over?

21:05.264 --> 21:06.181
Yeah.

21:06.265 --> 21:08.767
I feel left out now.
It's really upsetting.

21:08.850 --> 21:12.104
- Couldn't you jerks have woken me up?
- You said not to.

21:14.231 --> 21:15.232
Did I?

21:16.525 --> 21:17.776
Then wake me in ten.

21:52.019 --> 21:52.936
Is this him?

21:53.687 --> 21:55.272
Are you fucking kidding?

21:55.355 --> 21:57.691
Aren't you guys ashamed? This is wrong.

22:04.740 --> 22:06.116
I need to go study.

22:06.825 --> 22:07.868
Nothing personal.

22:09.661 --> 22:10.996
It's just business.

22:27.346 --> 22:29.348
Hey, that's Yeong-bin, right?

22:29.431 --> 22:31.433
- Whoa, scary.
- Fucking savage.

22:35.228 --> 22:39.358
Right, that's Yeong-bin's cousin.

22:49.493 --> 22:50.369
Ahn Su-ho.

22:52.704 --> 22:53.705
Ahn Su-ho!

22:56.041 --> 22:57.000
Jeon Yeong-bin,

22:57.084 --> 22:58.585
he's dragging Si-eun off.

23:00.629 --> 23:01.755
Jeon Yeong-bin.

23:01.838 --> 23:03.173
He's dragging Si-eun off.

23:03.256 --> 23:04.132
And?

23:04.966 --> 23:06.009
What?

23:06.093 --> 23:07.677
No, please help.

23:08.178 --> 23:09.262
You have to help.

23:09.346 --> 23:11.264
I heard you know martial arts.

23:12.224 --> 23:13.850
We aren't that close.

23:15.519 --> 23:17.979
How close do you need to be to help?

23:18.480 --> 23:19.898
Go find a teacher.

23:20.565 --> 23:21.566
I have to work.

23:23.318 --> 23:24.903
I'll pay you.

23:29.282 --> 23:30.659
Double what your job pays.

23:40.168 --> 23:42.212
Thank you, sir. Let's go.

23:43.797 --> 23:45.590
Let's hurry, valued customer!

23:51.012 --> 23:52.097
What's up? Get on.

24:02.816 --> 24:04.067
Look out for him.

24:27.090 --> 24:28.383
Go be the lookout.

24:29.843 --> 24:30.677
Wow.

24:32.554 --> 24:34.347
I'm really fucking bored.

24:34.931 --> 24:36.683
Are you little kids?

24:37.267 --> 24:39.519
Gil-su is calling. End it quickly.

24:40.187 --> 24:41.521
Seriously.

24:47.903 --> 24:48.737
His hand.

24:51.656 --> 24:53.158
Rip off the prick's hand

24:54.409 --> 24:55.785
so that he can't study.

24:57.871 --> 24:58.788
Three on the left.

24:58.872 --> 25:00.499
Beat them down quickly.

25:01.708 --> 25:04.669
Two on the right. Conditioned reflex.
Deal with them later if needed.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.388
I need to get the drop on him.

25:15.889 --> 25:17.015
Just end it quickly.

25:21.311 --> 25:22.145
What is this?

25:29.444 --> 25:30.737
Fuck!

26:10.694 --> 26:11.528
Move.

26:17.492 --> 26:18.326
Hey!

26:30.797 --> 26:31.673
I'm sorry.

26:31.756 --> 26:33.049
I underestimated you.

26:36.011 --> 26:37.053
Out of the way.

26:38.972 --> 26:40.599
Son of a bitch! Fuck you!

26:40.682 --> 26:42.934
Fucking bastard! Dumbass!

26:43.018 --> 26:47.856
Dumb piece of shit! Son of a bitch! Fuck!

26:49.774 --> 26:50.609
Hey.

26:51.109 --> 26:52.152
Grab his hands.

26:57.782 --> 26:59.034
Son of a bitch.

27:02.203 --> 27:03.538
You fucker.

27:09.044 --> 27:11.129
Know your fucking place.

27:11.212 --> 27:12.547
Fucking moron.

27:26.895 --> 27:28.396
Hey, you okay?

27:29.189 --> 27:30.106
Who's this punk?

27:33.026 --> 27:34.110
Are you okay?

27:38.114 --> 27:39.032
Don't leave me hanging.

27:50.710 --> 27:51.836
Let's call it a day.

27:52.420 --> 27:53.254
Yeah?

28:06.393 --> 28:07.310
Hey.

28:33.503 --> 28:35.588
Hey, grab that asshole.

28:44.264 --> 28:45.390
Fucker!

29:19.924 --> 29:20.925
Tap out, fucker.

29:21.885 --> 29:23.011
You're going to die.

29:39.569 --> 29:40.904
Hey!

30:09.516 --> 30:10.850
Good job.

30:15.939 --> 30:17.023
Anyways.

30:17.941 --> 30:20.151
Aren't you embarrassed, ganging up on him?

30:21.820 --> 30:24.572
If it were me, I'd die of shame.

30:31.246 --> 30:32.121
Seok-dae.

30:33.039 --> 30:34.040
What are you doing?

30:36.626 --> 30:37.627
Do your job.

30:38.378 --> 30:39.212
Hey.

30:42.924 --> 30:44.634
Looks like he is embarrassed.

30:48.888 --> 30:50.139
That's enough for today.

30:52.350 --> 30:53.184
He's leaving.

30:55.311 --> 30:57.480
Hey, Gil-su called.

31:01.526 --> 31:02.527
Hurry, let's go!

31:02.610 --> 31:05.071
Seriously?

31:08.908 --> 31:09.742
Jeon Yeong-bin.

31:11.327 --> 31:12.161
Stop it.

31:17.542 --> 31:18.459
I said stop.

31:27.343 --> 31:28.177
Let's go.

31:36.936 --> 31:39.647
Let me see. Oh, it's really scraped up.

31:49.282 --> 31:51.117
I really worked up an appetite.

31:51.826 --> 31:52.827
Let's go eat.

31:53.411 --> 31:54.662
I know a good place.

31:56.456 --> 31:57.582
It's on you, right?

32:09.218 --> 32:10.470
What's up? Get on.

32:11.763 --> 32:14.057
- I need to go to cram school.
- Come on, man.

32:14.140 --> 32:18.186
You can't even muster up
a thank you to your saviors?

32:19.729 --> 32:21.397
I said I know a great place.

32:44.921 --> 32:47.215
I'll pay, so eat what you want.

32:47.298 --> 32:48.758
Sorry I'm late.

32:48.841 --> 32:50.593
Oh, Su-ho, you're so late!

32:50.677 --> 32:52.261
- Yes.
- Did you eat?

32:52.345 --> 32:55.056
- Not yet. We'll eat later.
- Oh, that's too bad.

32:57.809 --> 33:00.144
I was late because of you guys,

33:00.228 --> 33:01.104
so help out.

33:01.604 --> 33:03.356
You're Su-ho's friends?

33:03.439 --> 33:04.399
Hello.

33:10.196 --> 33:12.365
It needs to shine!

33:15.076 --> 33:17.370
Where did you learn to wash so well?

33:17.453 --> 33:20.540
Your mother must be so proud.
Such a precious boy!

33:27.046 --> 33:28.798
There's one more box.

33:34.554 --> 33:35.930
You have two jobs?

33:38.433 --> 33:40.643
I do deliveries three times a week.

33:40.727 --> 33:41.728
Not every day.

33:44.731 --> 33:45.606
Isn't it hard?

33:48.609 --> 33:49.861
It is what it is.

33:50.695 --> 33:52.572
I work as a mover on weekends.

33:56.451 --> 33:57.285
Why?

33:59.495 --> 34:01.497
Do you respect me now?

34:03.708 --> 34:05.710
Welcome! Come on in.

34:06.210 --> 34:07.128
Finish this up.

34:08.588 --> 34:10.673
What can I get you? Take your time.

34:29.358 --> 34:30.234
So…

34:33.488 --> 34:34.822
about the mock test…

34:35.531 --> 34:38.493
I'm really… sorry.

34:39.118 --> 34:41.704
Yeong-bin threatened me.

34:43.539 --> 34:46.084
And I really didn't know what it was.

34:50.088 --> 34:50.922
I know.

34:51.589 --> 34:52.423
It's fine.

34:59.597 --> 35:01.432
Damn, I'm starving.

35:17.990 --> 35:19.200
Is it better that way?

35:32.588 --> 35:35.216
- To die for, yeah?
- Oh, it's hot.

35:35.716 --> 35:36.634
So hot!

35:44.433 --> 35:45.309
Okay, then!

35:45.893 --> 35:47.603
Si-eun, one for you too?

35:48.938 --> 35:52.191
Eat it in one big bite
to really taste the meat.

35:53.943 --> 35:54.819
You eat it.

35:55.528 --> 35:56.612
Man.

35:57.488 --> 36:00.741
No one's ever regretted listening to me.

36:00.825 --> 36:02.410
Say, "Ah."

36:03.536 --> 36:04.370
"Ah!"

36:06.539 --> 36:07.707
Did you wash your hands?

36:08.457 --> 36:09.709
Dammit.

36:09.792 --> 36:11.460
This dude knows nothing.

36:11.544 --> 36:13.921
Hands make the food taste better.

36:14.881 --> 36:18.426
It's fine. "Ah!" Come on.

36:20.469 --> 36:21.304
"Ah."

36:24.557 --> 36:26.517
How is it? To die for, right?

36:26.601 --> 36:27.435
Yeah?

36:29.187 --> 36:30.021
Right?

36:34.317 --> 36:35.401
It's really tasty.

36:35.484 --> 36:37.111
Right? You'll have to come back!

36:37.862 --> 36:38.905
- Can I?
- Yeah.

36:44.035 --> 36:47.622
FATHER: WHERE ARE YOU?
DIDN'T YOU GO TO CRAM SCHOOL?

37:11.354 --> 37:14.565
SU-HO, THAT WAS SO TASTY
LET'S GO AGAIN

37:16.609 --> 37:22.657
SU-HO, FOLLOW ME BACK ON INSTAGRAM

37:43.844 --> 37:45.930
If you get a lot of business experience,

37:46.013 --> 37:50.101
there are many opportunities
to make money in our country.

37:50.184 --> 37:51.018
DELIVERY ORDER

37:51.102 --> 37:53.187
I'm a real estate agent, but--

38:02.363 --> 38:05.658
Next, I'm going to talk about
indeterminate equations.

38:05.741 --> 38:10.204
These are a core part
of high school mathematics,

38:10.288 --> 38:14.000
and it's a concept used
in all areas of mathematics.

38:14.083 --> 38:16.836
We'll take a closer look today.

38:16.919 --> 38:18.879
Now, indeterminate equations.

38:18.963 --> 38:21.924
So why do we call this
an indeterminate equation?

38:22.008 --> 38:27.430
It's an equation
that doesn't have a fixed solution.

38:27.513 --> 38:29.223
Why is it like this?

38:29.307 --> 38:33.519
There isn't just a single solution,

38:33.602 --> 38:37.481
and it's hard to say
that one of them is the answer.

38:37.565 --> 38:41.027
To solve this equation…

38:56.542 --> 38:57.877
Fucking bastard.

38:59.962 --> 39:00.838
Who was it?

41:46.921 --> 41:48.714
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

41:48.797 --> 41:50.299
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

41:50.799 --> 41:54.053
